### Crash fixes {#2.5.3-crash-fixes}

<div class="changelog-entry">

Fixes various crashes that could occur when:

- making a Lua HTTP request from a coroutine
- clicking the "Install" button for an update on Linux or macOS
- closing down Chatterino
- trying to search in an uninitialized split

{{ credit(author="Mm2PL, pajlada", prs="5800, 5818, 6018, 6057") }}

</div>

### Windows shortcut {#2.5.3-windows-shortcut}

<div class="changelog-entry">

We've made some changes to the shortcut on Windows - this means that you might
have to recreate the shortcut pointing to Chatterino in your start menu or
task bar.
This change was necessary to ensure desktop notifications can fetch the
correct application information when they're being displayed.

{{ credit(author="8thony", prs="5975") }}

</div>

### Join order {#2.5.3-join-order}

<div class="changelog-entry">

If you have a lot of channels open, you might have noticed that Chatterino can
be slow at joining some of them.
We now prioritize joining the channels that are in your active tab, reducing the time-to-type-a-message by anywhere from 0 seconds to 60 seconds!

{{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="5850") }}

</div>

