### Linux desktop notifications {#2.5.3-linux-desktop-notifications}

<div class="changelog-entry">

We now support desktop notifications on Linux using
[libnotify](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libnotify). This requires
you to be running a desktop notification daemon. You probably already have one
installed, if not you can install and run [dunst](https://dunst-project.org/).

{{ credit(author="camporter, 4rneee", prs="5881, 5971, 5976") }}

</div>

