### Miscellaneous changes {#2.5.3-miscellaneous-changes}

<div class="changelog-entry">

- You can now allow other browser extensions to interact with Chatterino. {{ credit(author="MiguVT", prs="5997", inline=true) }}

- Added `Set highlight sounds` and `Open subscription page` hotkeys. {{ credit(author="brian6932", prs="5856, 6030", inline=true) }}

- `/clear` messages now stack like timeouts. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="5806", inline=true) }}

- Updated browser list for incognito browser support. {{ credit(author="teknsl, Wissididom", prs="5805, 5810", inline=true) }}

- Improved error messaging of the `/clip` command. {{ credit(author="pajlada", prs="5879", inline=true) }}

- Clicking on a live notification can now open the channel in a custom player. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="5880", inline=true) }}

- Hotkeys and their keybinds are now searchable. {{ credit(author="apa420", prs="5884", inline=true) }}

- Overlay windows can now be zoomed independently (by default: <kbd>CTRL</kbd>+<kbd>+</kbd>/<kbd>-</kbd>). {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="6016", inline=true) }}

- The `/watching` channel is now supported on all platforms. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="6031, 6043", inline=true) }}

- You can now customize the font weight of chat messages. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="6037", inline=true) }}

- Added the ability to filter on messages by the author's user ID. {{ credit(author="apa420", prs="5862", inline=true) }}

  Example filter: `author.user_id == "22484632"`

- Messages from restricted users are now hidden in streamer mode. {{ credit(author="pajlada", prs="6042, 6049", inline=true) }}

  You can disable this in settings.

- Linux & macOS now cleanly handle SIGINT/SIGTERM signals. {{ credit(author="pajlada", prs="6053", inline=true) }}

</div>

